    "title_en": "Exact partition function of arithmetic Ising model",
    "abstract_en": "We present a compact formula for the exact partition function of the $d$-dimensional arithmetic Ising model (AIM). For a $2\\times2$ system, we express it analytically using the $q$-Hurwitz-Lerch zeta function and derive explicit forms for the free energy and entropy. Additionally, we find that the entropy increases at high temperatures, supporting the presence of entropic order.",
